```java
// The main class extends SpringBootServletInitializer for WAR deployment
@SpringBootApplication
public class OrderServiceApplication extends SpringBootServletInitializer {

    // Called by the external servlet container (e.g. standalone Tomcat)
    @Override
    protected SpringApplicationBuilder configure(SpringApplicationBuilder builder) {
        return builder.sources(OrderServiceApplication.class);
    }

    // Still runs as an executable JAR during development
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        SpringApplication.run(OrderServiceApplication.class, args);
    }
}
```

*Also set `<packaging>war</packaging>` in pom.xml and mark `spring-boot-starter-tomcat` with `<scope>provided</scope>` so the embedded server is excluded from the WAR.*
